WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:11.860
Before the rain, the greenhouse holds its breath. One last drop waits above a machine that has forgotten how to wake.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:19.080
Then gravity decides. The drop enters the guide, gathers speed, and meets the wheel.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:26.780
That small contact turns a larger promise. Teeth carry motion forward, each gear awakening the next.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:35.880
At the far end, rotation becomes lift. A cam raises the stem toward the waiting light.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:45.360
Nothing is automatic. Each change depends on the last: fall, contact, turn, rise.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:01:00.181
When the flower opens, the machine disappears. What remains is its quiet idea: even the smallest cause can become a world of consequences.
